cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "The US Government UFO Files (war.gov/ufo), analyzed"
abstract: "Every record the US Department of War released on war.gov/ufo: documents, photographs, videos and audio about unidentified anomalous phenomena (UAP), with the agency, incident date and place, release date, page count, redaction status, the official source link, an archived copy, and a plain-English summary and story page from Aliens magazine for each record. Updated whenever a new release appears."
